  "decisions": [
    "Save each picker selection immediately, then publish the confirmed preferences to the app shell. Reset confirms before atomically replacing the single app-private record.",
    "Missing preference fields default to System. Invalid fields in a recognized version default individually. Unrecognized, missing schema, malformed envelope and unreadable records use safe defaults and require Reset before replacement.",
    "Larger has an xxxLarge floor and keeps any larger Dynamic Type category.",
    "The regional locale is used for display dates in the queue, draft list, saved entry list and saved entry detail. Editor input, timestamp bytes, guest messages, report export and workspace writes keep their existing paths."
  ],
